Package: BRLVM
Type: Package
Title: Bayesian Regularized Latent Variable Modeling
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(
        given = "Yifan",
        family = "Zhang",
        role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
        email = "zyf2020@connect.hku.hk"
    )
Maintainer: Yifan Zhang <zyf2020@connect.hku.hk>
Description: Implements Bayesian regularization methods for latent variable
    modeling, with a focus on partially confirmatory latent variable models.
    The package supports regularization of factor loadings, factor correlation
    structures, and residual covariance structures using lasso, horseshoe,
    and spike-and-slab priors. It also supports categorical indicators,
    missing data, and complex measurement structures, including bifactor,
    multitrait-multimethod, and testlet models. The package was developed as
    part of the author's PhD thesis on Bayesian regularization for latent
    variable modeling.
